sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User Controls & Safety
    participant A as Arm Motion Control
    participant G as Gripper & Object Handling
    Note over U,G: All signals 0 / 3.3 V on the 8-pin ribbon. Pull-downs make every unplugged input read 0 (stop).
    U->>A: SAFE_OK = 1 (pin 1)
    U->>G: SAFE_OK = 1 (pin 1)
    U->>A: SPEED_SET = 0 to 3.3 V (pin 6, DAC)
    U->>A: RUN_REQ = 1 (pin 2, Start pressed)
    Note over A: move joint to PICK at SPEED_SET speed
    A->>G: ARM_IN_POS = 1 (pin 5)
    A->>G: GRIP_CMD = 1 (pin 3, close)
    Note over G: close servo until FSR 402 force > threshold
    G->>A: OBJ_HELD = 1 (pin 4)
    G->>U: GRIP_FORCE = force voltage (pin 7, DAC)
    A->>G: ARM_IN_POS = 0 (moving)
    Note over A: move joint to PLACE
    A->>G: ARM_IN_POS = 1
    A->>G: GRIP_CMD = 0 (open)
    G->>A: OBJ_HELD = 0
    Note over U,G: cycle repeats while RUN_REQ = 1
    U-->>A: SAFE_OK = 0 (E-stop) at any time
    U-->>G: SAFE_OK = 0
    Note over A,G: Arm PWM to 0 %, Gripper holds, User shows red LED + buzzer
